    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Combined Attack Legend&quot; is a game that you can play in your free time, allowing you to experience the most primitive pastoral feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich system:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission system and achievement system enable players to obtain abundant rewards to train higher-level pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lucky draw system offers feed, random pets, while the store and collection systems enhance game play experiences, providing more ways to engage with the game.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Combined Attack Legend&quot; is a game that you can play in your free time, allowing you to experience the most primitive pastoral feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich system:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission system and achievement system enable players to obtain abundant rewards to train higher-level pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lucky draw system offers feed, random pets, while the store and collection systems enhance game play experiences, providing more ways to engage with the game.</p></li></ul>",
